<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="dark">
<head>
        <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10b981">
    <title>Donate - Al-Quran Digital</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        body { background-color: #05070f; color: white; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
        .cosmic-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -1; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%); background-color: #04060d; }
        .glass-card { background: rgba(13, 18, 30, 0.65); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
        .glass-nav { background: rgba(5, 7, 15, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <div class="cosmic-bg"></div>

    <nav class="sticky top-0 z-40 glass-nav h-20 flex items-center px-4 lg:px-12">
        <a href="/" class="text-slate-300 hover:text-emerald-400 font-medium flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i>Kembali ke Beranda</a>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart text-rose-400 text-4xl"></i>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4 text-white">Dukung Kami</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Website Al-Quran Digital ini disediakan secara gratis dan bebas iklan. Bantuan donasi dari Anda akan sepenuhnya digunakan untuk <strong class="text-emerald-400">memperpanjang masa aktif server (hosting & domain)</strong> agar platform ini bisa terus online dan diakses oleh banyak orang.
        </p>

        <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-2xl text-left border-rose-500/20 max-w-md mx-auto">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-4 border-b border-slate-700 pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-wallet text-emerald-400 mr-2"></i> Metode Donasi</h3>
            
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <!-- Lo ganti nomer/link nya ntar pake punya lo sendiri -->
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-300">QRIS / Gopay / OVO</span>
                    <a href="#" class="px-4 py-1.5 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition">Saweria</a>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-3 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-300">BCA</span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm tracking-wider">1234567890</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-6 text-center">Terima kasih atas kebaikan Anda. Semoga menjadi amal jariyah.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="glass-nav py-6 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm mt-auto border-t border-slate-800">
        <p><i class="fa-solid fa-code text-emerald-400 mr-1"></i> Dikembangkan oleh <span class="text-slate-300 font-bold">Risqy</span> | Al-Quran Digital &copy; 2026</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>